--- stderr
factory state workitem: want 1 argument(s), got []
usage: factory state workitem WORKITEM [--state-dir DIR | --state-url URL] [--json]
  -json
    	print the objects as JSON instead of tables
  -state-dir string
    	the dispatcher's state dir (default $FACTORY_STATE_DIR, else ~/.factory/state)
  -state-url string
    	the dispatchers' shared state: gs://bucket/prefix, s3://bucket/prefix or file:///dir (instead of --state-dir)
